	"Name": "Omega's Great Compatibility Patch",
	"Author": "OmegaFallon",
	"Description": "What this mod Adds:\u00A0\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Wine Aging for products from the following mods:\u00A0Secret Gourmet,\u00A0\u00A0Champagne Wishes, Walk to the Desert Redux, Stardew Valley Expanded, Stardew Vineyard, Grapes of Ferngill\n<br />[*]Small fixes to maps and warps for FungusAmoungus\n<br />[*]Concession Tastes updates for Olivia(SVE), Pam, Evelyn\n<br />[*]Updated Category Tags across Multiple Mods\n<br />[*]Gift Reactions and Compatibility to Various Mods and Vanilla game: Examples Abigail(Vanilla) and Aideen (East Scarp) love Elven Comb from Ridgeside\n<br />[*]Makes Gwen from Downtown Zuzu friend with Shiko\u00A0\n<br />[*]Adds Compatability for Industrial Furance with Cookie Clicker Suite, More Gems, and Strange Machines\n<br />[*]Updated Item Descriptions from Various Mods\n<br />[*]Changes Pam's Potato Juice Special Order to Vodka\n<br />[*]Sprite Edits for a mod? (This one is unclear to me)\n<br />[*]Adds Unifies Grapes and Machines that Process Grapes from: Grapes of Ferngill, Stardew Vineyard, Champagne Wishes and Fizzy Drinks\n<br />[*]Add Producer Framework Manager rules for Lemonade Machine\n<br />[*]Adds Unity between items and machines from other mods such as: Strange Machines, Plentiful Harvet Produce, Tropical Farm, Walk to the Desert (I think this mean redux) Seems to have compatibility with PPJA's Artisan Valley?\n<br />[*]Updates Categories from various mods and vanilla for Better Crafting Mod\n<br />[*]Adds some Unique Reactions for Gifts\n<br />[*]Copyedit\u00A0of Event Lookup\n<br />[*]Adds a Stand for Lemonade with Lemonade Machine?\n<br />[*]Copyedit of Rented Tools\n<br />[/list]\n<br />If you don't have one of the mods, you should simply get a \"no manifest.json\" error, which is harmless. If it truly does bug you, simply delete the folders for mods which you don't have.\n<br />\n<br />(credit to masteredge3 for compiling a description)",
